    <string name="onboarding_1_title">Your LSA and FFE register, offline</string>
    <string name="onboarding_1_body">Everything lives on this phone. No account, no server, no signal needed — it works the same in the middle of an ocean as it does alongside.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_2_title">Build the ship deck by deck</string>
    <string name="onboarding_2_body">Start from a plan preset, stack the decks, then drop equipment where it actually is. Tap any marker to see what is due on it.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_3_title">Grade with one tap</string>
    <string name="onboarding_3_body">Five condition grades, 56 mm targets, gloves-on. Sweep a deck item by item and the round writes itself.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_4_title">One file to send anywhere</string>
    <string name="onboarding_4_body">Export a self-contained HTML report that opens by double-click, prints cleanly and can be imported back on another phone.</string>

